        "ID_MAPSELECTION_SPACEPORT_SUBTITLE": "Acerra",
        "ID_MAPSELECTION_SPACEPORT_TITLE": "Spaceport",
        "ID_MAPSELECTION_DAM_DESCRIPTION": "Alcantara Power Plant, or \"The Dam\", once served as a crucial Raider stronghold during the bitter closing battles of the First Wave. Even now, these toxic, waterlogged lands remain a hotspot for ARC skirmishes.",
        "ID_MAPSELECTION_DAM_FULL": "Dam Battlegrounds",
        "ID_MAPSELECTION_DAM_SUBTITLE": "Dam",
        "ID_MAPSELECTION_DAM_TITLE": "Battlegrounds",
        "ID_MAPSELECTION_SPACEPORT_DESCRIPTION": "Acerra Spaceport is a majestic testament to humanity's past ambitions. This is where the Exodus shuttles, vessels of hope and desperation, once roared into the heavens, leaving a beleaguered Earth behind.",
        "ID_MAPSELECTION_DAM_SHORT": "Dam Battlegrounds",
