        "ID_MAPSELECTION_BURIEDCITY_DESCRIPTION": "Amidst the sand dunes in this arid wasteland you will find a remnant of the old world quite unlike the cold steel spires of the Exodus age. Walk these narrow streets and empty plazas, and know that people once lived here.",
