        "ID_MAPSELECTION_PRACTICERANGE_DESCRIPTION": "Nestled in a secluded mountain hollow, the echoed gunshots from this practice range seem to confuse ARC's sense of direction, creating a rare pocket of open-air safety. Raiders use the Backyard to hone their skills, and catch up on some long-overdue stargazing.",
